      "content": "it's not just a \"heavy weight\" though. it's like... the fundamental purpose is gone. i spent my whole life believing that if i could just create something beautiful, it would make the existence worthwhile. but now that the well is dry, it feels like the whole reason for being here has just evaporated. what am i supposed to do with a life that has no meaning left in it? it just feels so hollow.",
